  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Signet. Target foe takes 15...63...75 damage. If that foe is under the effects of a hex or enchantment, foes adjacent to your target take 5...41...50 damage.",
      "zhTW": "對目標敵人造成 15～75 傷害，若目標有加持或者降咒，則對鄰近該目標的其他敵人造成 5～50 傷害。"
    },
    "pvp": {
      "en": "Signet. Target foe takes 10...50...60 damage. If that foe is under the effects of a hex or enchantment, foes adjacent to your target take 10...50...60 damage. All your non-Mesmer skills except signets are disabled for 10 seconds.",
      "zhTW": "對目標敵人造成 10～60 傷害，若目標有加持或者降咒，則對鄰近該目標的其他敵人造成 10～60 傷害。同時你的非幻術師的技能，紋章除外，在 10 秒內無法使用。"
    }
  },
